  <para xml:id="p2">
    <p>In Algorithm <ref labelref="LABEL:alg:euclid"/>, line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:alc:mod"/> initializes the remainder.
The loop spanning lines <ref labelref="LABEL:line:alc:while"/>–<ref labelref="LABEL:line:alc:endwhile"/> reduces the inputs,
and line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:alc:ret"/> returns the result.
Standalone line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:alc:standalone"/> executes outside any float.</p>
  </para>
